{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1345,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:535826bb128388074ca5f3e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……久违地玩玩看吧，烧落叶。\n飘忽不定的火焰、木头烧焦的爆鸣……\n我还挺喜欢的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69113c5f37f1c9d3f28d88c511297505cf0059c852224077be620ce01ae90e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6847fb975f5e76a60578ec10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的话果然就得一个人吃火锅啊。\n做起来方便，收拾起来也轻松……\n……盯着我干嘛啊。我不会叫你的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d94dad535deac2fd0f7fd94c04506cab8c8bc8bd07edebaeabd972a3cf0e6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1afcc70abdb40f6e9c04eef9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一副睡眼惺忪的样子啊。你最近松懈过头了吧？\r\n要我再紧紧你脑子里的螺丝吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da2de2ef16236e555abce90e189a080406935066f07d0b41c2747056a6966829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b99d96745bd2497132a9a2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……呣……虽说是经验值三倍提升的活动，\r\n但也实在太肝了……\r\n差不多该收手别继续提升等级了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "395409da469a24a19917557f294ed13abf589ba39369867212c86b9c20d53c43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ff972591336be8dc51bfd50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想用VR UMA聊天室的话又得排队啊……\r\n预约的人也不少……\r\n……以后应该会增设几台吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5778045b39219e9019389071f68253e7a31f7bc7e761cea413bd65ebe6737a4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceced4fed44412bdde35aef1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那片云……感觉里面随时会飞出飞艇来啊。\r\n然后，乘着那个飞艇踏上拯救世界的旅途……\r\n……不行，太蹩脚了，一股子烂作的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "674c1d63e08a977733479a66bb02801f181cd1eee0f61b5b5f1107b1e7c80c23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee46c34621106fb1497c7f57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "游戏的工房里充斥着一股机油味……\r\n但总觉得……是种微妙地没法讨厌的味道啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a84cd58962707bc6696f6fe719de4ac0f3d1d1cdb99939a7c375430505d206d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc619f44b0539152ff65c5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的攻击对那个敌人完全不起效果！\r\n开发组……你们还挺厉害的啊。\r\n可恶……睡前再打一次……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba2f64f7179fb6944afbc6fb6c6c0dab0704285442445011b95656ab6a23e4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3370fe43a4b998384a734836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天降毛毛虫什么的太犯规了吧！\r\n甚至还发出些奇怪的声音……！\r\n放弃这款游戏罢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1e689194b1392e34d10dd2413c687e0cacabe569385ffcda7bddc55d82a4d17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4c17e931ba00fad1377aefd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很热，但还可以忍受吧。\r\nVR的工房里可热得跟桑拿一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d4b2b8c280217c53a27321fd821d5f66fb3bb7f90c01bbc1ee477cb730a22b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce065ac9c11f56e685e7002b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这世上还有蒸汽机车在运行啊……\r\n要是远征去到那附近的话就去看看吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a36e6d0bf9d67d9f4002fb0f33eb7647592cf40e0a6d1eda0959d9433a4cfcb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f99714061f8de5e0c89b263",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近手机耗电有点快啊……\r\n一冷起来就会这样了。\r\n……是我玩太久了？不，但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d14d60795179263ee19490f9ddd115c8852f884605da0656ebc3b26914b62df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab389b1075407db01afddec2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc57123f885ae4d8ca01b3f9a0272c02a7209bac15114e15a93cf348bd95edcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23c05ca3814cb18d55f790e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc57123f885ae4d8ca01b3f9a0272c02a7209bac15114e15a93cf348bd95edcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3cde7ec02a3fc556931690f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ふぁ。昨日落としたゲーム、\r\n危うく朝まで遊ぶ勢いだったな…。\r\n昼寝できるとこ空いてればいいけど",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed0cfefcd2bad569268eb9fe868402e1f646b77c8ff6303f61115426a7221d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1ad659d52e576cf9ce076e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝って、時間食われるんだよね。\r\nログボ回収にデイリー消化。\r\n…途切れさせんのもイヤだし。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c453f9684370995d87a1bf698c9feef693ba3ecc8f52d7c44fa2a6c1e4de0c85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44f0f4ee4502540358a7e39c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やばっ、もう昼？どうしよ…\r\n全然お腹減ってない。持ってきた\r\nサンドウィッチ、半分は残しそう…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb358247e762f79b2eb740da6019a89ebaebf981c19854d0072bf8937a2bd55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3869d8f8309331776322e330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハヤヒデとチケット、ランチ\r\n誘っといて何でどこにもいないわけ\r\n用がないときはいっつもいるクセに",
      "source_fingerprint": "f415276d86a5b53f67942822a78d6edc409d8c6d10b57e4c6af48ee42d5ba665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18548bd1406468c85e010441",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライツ博士の研究所の変な機材、\r\n弄ってたら夜になってんだけど…\r\nや、なんかパズルゲーっぽくて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c1f16659c45ec3073854ae7c3e18e5caf920490aa5442058509b1d4c544219",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49365c2707ff2cf5851af13a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "何こんな時間まで頑張ってんの？\r\n無理しても体壊すだけじゃん。\r\n早く寝たら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "087614a23b2310b3afb33f7cf99fded9eadf6be59c0b7c805bf5c442fe9f83b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1f734c328ace1610455de1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "過ごしやすい季節になると、どこも\r\n人が多くなってさ…。お気に入りの\r\nスポット、また探さないとじゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ab8b26b0df0aaf9ab7bab1feb591f73b2e7875d64d9e13abb92c050429d750",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b0cd4d7b5d7d55c7df2d1a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暑っ…。チケットが押しつけてきた\r\nアイス、ハヤヒデにあげるんじゃ\r\nなかった…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d118cedc09046f510497b82b184ce5ca094179359a1cc118601edb490382fccb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a283f369d92274060b2ec511",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落ち葉焚きと甘い香り…焼き芋大会\r\nでもしてんのかな？人多そうだから\r\n絶対行かないけど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a20bbbfee9be8ff027f5ca4556e579d6c3474e4782b5bea1bbf380f0ab00c114",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4003d3e7079a2677087d1670",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そと寒っ…。走って体温めるか、\r\n部屋でぬくぬくゲームするか…\r\n迷うな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0070b6f816f0b98aa53d5b22ea00a977d3bc721a585cd0b68d9ee4df293da026",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20a164db9a992b095c60a1c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……ハッピーバレンタイン",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff507df3f646d0da7f5a74b8941cfabdf2b60e4bee9f62f0d62dd0b69cea0b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f32c7720b8ed783b4a80104a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奖券那家伙……\n一边猛摇我一边喊什么『耐震测试！！』\n……我又不是什么建筑物。（注：耐震与大进发音一样）。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0987a6cb3ed6c6875fb91731b13c26ff8c60cf20ffd3494fdfb9edec963af6bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd348864495dc68f738a691",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看了眼我在手游里的排名，吓了我一跳……\n果然玩的时间久了就是这样吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9d501ed95d47ed339fcc35a3defe981155cb49fb8d76995c075a00a604521bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9697fa8c6d1b9d5d504bdf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听了广播之后，\n无意间自己放了在广播里被点播过的曲子……\n不……哎。就是这样",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0a0de2c8ced8c65eb2dcd2fe719eb2c72afc78d9d1b82093415d6b42d67cacf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2659db9671f4f18017b35238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是所有东西都可以网购就好了……\n店里面人群吵得要命，店员也很话多……",
      "source_fingerprint": "61fe26993c148b41567b58a028fbf397d23694c6207398734ad476c4751d22eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a912a33734d7e57daae9e3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就是自己洗了洗衣服，溪流同学就在旁边夸个不停……\n……自己的事情我还是能自己做好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aa6499462338a52de0ae3609d37b0695706afeec3dcfb10560ee85117060aaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1dc3652ac9b0ca6b4ddc3da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜者舞台啊……\n让比赛里胜利的姑娘们去唱歌跳舞……\n这种事情是谁想出来的啊。真是的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad7b557f942366624e8aef7e2b2f7e390ee9e1bbf45edf656d36ca498e5eac23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:058dd3f5104b7f90a601a626",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……要是穿上同样的衣服的话，\n立马就能察觉到体格的差距啊……\n……不，没什么。忘了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f62683cc08a863bd7b70765fd4dda33d5b8b5d16db1a13465b0e7aaa6712451b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef135c066521b01f2a96969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服的风帽很棒啊。\n套上就能让我无视掉那些恼人的视线，\n在冲线后再摘下来的话，又能看见截然不同的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abba0a5bcd3ad2918504e2cf976488148e338ff9fa6a764f368d0dace000f0c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04bb61082f70917746c740ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "话说回来，我刚发现\r\n自己有好多不对称的衣服啊…\r\n…大概只是巧合吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5958fefed672aa5db7174dfbac0a863da688b3ebdc256ed38ab236bdd8cbdcd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84e6c7acc652462ea829a305",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把便当忘在宿舍了，回去拿又很麻烦……\n想着要出去吃吧，\n但最近又老是把甜品店和餐厅搞混……哈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5515150f361b7cbb705dd61e145e8b079a0f80ce66425d058cf26f23fe3db4e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bd3d43447a1de0690a11fb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休的时候去了趟图书馆。然后，\n晨光说着『这是名著』，拿了本超厚的书过来……\n我赶紧逃走了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4badc2501414eeef95a042a41b2f6c048571f4d4bdc47866240677e260f6655d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a001291d74fedc0b9af2e8e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，那个游戏的活动今天就结束了啊……\n也没那么喜欢玩游戏。\n只是偶尔玩玩来打发一下时间而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0521e15ca3129871d0618fa6f90fe11e3a85606f065c54abd2f7a526d5d874f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47c40afbda3f817d090ac2e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的，不就是迎新会吗……\n我会好好干的……\n说到底，为什么要我来给新生带路啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c9ef32882088e3ca35118d899da330cbf444e95bf159010307091285a7337a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f33bc08eb495eea25c3f7dcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想去空荡荡的海边玩呢……\n想看看海葵长什么样子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af7a114996c71a17874194200a31a6551d2d1291007757cb16b7585f96635c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66b3dc39a9b0c291647b5de2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在公园看见了相当少见的鸟啊……\n难不成是候鸟吗……？\n……真好啊，不管多远都能飞到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cbb2cc88eaf0f79994589c0ac359570cb7338f1187dfef608a9b95f19c19db6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4291aa332eb929fb4e98b0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个学校，\n冬天的时候活动特别多，吵得要命……哈啊。\n下大雪的话，会不会安静……哎，不可能的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9a85eaa185730b992c792348068c9d28cc387393a69eb490b5d2d2b5eb1d9c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05d1b15c8903e29d555815a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然问我能不能设计个按一下就能检查蹄铁状况的按钮……\r\n奖券那家伙，真的知道工程师到底是做什么的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6492e5e1f3713ca558f5d0291e93b2080cfe23e2ae8990e12a0377ab9d963143",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19542e13a4fd9d57dba67d1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晨光邀请我和她用解谜游戏对战，\r\n似乎是款考验反应速度的游戏啊。\r\n……哼，我可不打算就这么输掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3024026de2851da08a0fd3970292bac01d5144cf415c09417e46e3081ebcef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1111d29701e5b42ad5b4e46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王在VR里的动作很奇怪啊……\r\n是因为游戏无法还原她那样的柔韧性吗？\r\n哈……居然是在现实里更强的家伙啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13da10680f45c838bb2ad07458f077ec2eca06589aff3b2fa1bacae473676d99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe6ad1d4c93d66ffbb43323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……刚和涡轮撞了个满怀。\r\n虽然彼此身上都有点小饰品什么的，\r\n但身高方面应该是我占优吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "83508382ae484a1afd1e92ae07ea893c37ec60b40484a07c1d76aeac7a4719fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d7b04f792d8d445a3c7b0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "齿轮这种东西很适合盯着发呆啊……\r\n那样有节奏感的动作和声音……\r\n感觉能一直盯到海枯石烂啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e314e6ced2f2f738879d445a8f7b03895afec4741cabb9b28477e6ec29d9142",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ce3964d2755c3f69142c32c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的朝雾……感觉和以往不一样，\r\n就像是误入了异世界一般啊……\r\n……唉，游戏玩太多了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a30386ee43ef762c6bd3d2e8dddf183804148e3d1c8e6dab8fa87c371be633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b222dfae9349ee87f3ccc52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……晨光也太哆嗦了吧……\r\n不就是在吃午饭的时候玩了玩游戏嘛……\r\n下次可不能被她发现……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfc24a34513a3bc84fc8b27cea93ffcdb8b57190b1b3f624123b81ad9b520ac7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cd62c404e72f8ba55171a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好险……差点忘了进APP领登录奖励……\r\n要是错过这个的话，\r\n又得推迟装备强化的计划……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b967f1962dde0f1647453cb912b555452108b8565f32037ee5897d81c4b5c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f5f799000fc051b82992da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近好像暖和起来了……\r\n偶尔也该散步去公园，然后……\r\n玩玩游戏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ef9450db50fa21cc0580597ceae75a89c236a732ed3a2cd9bb465cf79907558",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b96419c51ee2f478298f321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近游戏的广告尽是些泳装。\r\n怎么说呢……我也蛮讨厌仅仅因此就感觉到夏天的自己的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d444c906f1e9da977b3eea9483ed3d4fe67c19ef0a7a7ef860792d1277164d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b3abc675ed2410a95cbae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近用VR玩的游戏里，\r\n那些人都用蒸汽来烤地瓜。\r\n呵……真是神奇的世界观啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aecade34cc15a6bc7d5e703a6e69915d1e910cae4c2e5be72bc903365c8e8182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf386469f20c60623717e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷。玩玩UMA聊天室吧……\r\n在游戏里要取暖可就简单多了。\r\n又玩了游戏又能暖和起来，一石二鸟啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4732ee1b29326fdefbbdc5655537b5df2d2a9d369f053eaad9337bbd55d77b5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ef72f78afea9f7b5a58153c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯，什么？你刚刚说什么？\r\n我耳罩里还塞着耳机，\r\n有点听不清你说话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab89b167e3ec1a7fc427f478a484489a39bb1454713eae88fbe4ae1bbc912e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9212c148ef37d51d2c7da68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我眼睛好得很，没有近视。\r\n……别在昏暗的地方玩游戏，\r\n这种程度的防护措施就足够了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f5b5a9a53b9a9be7a0c987d6939a159e4c3b324c7391c80b2d8b0649e8d3e29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a19c62bc2ce868e6eca8981",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライスって背もアタシと同じぐらい\r\nなのに意外と食べるよね。\r\n何かコツでもあんのかな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bee74ce910a13cb053d4f2949d6fea42a3d92d8c9f442af06e65c252fae3402d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acf9617aea969cc7727c2482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨日マッチした相手、やたら強いと\r\n思ったらシャカールだったし…。\r\nID覚えたから、次は容赦しない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de70b8b03a265563303346a777fb251236561457ec1b50f07b82726ffa1f486",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8742a288a30cd0e6324e91f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスエスのアドバイス…\r\n意思疎通に必死だからつい\r\n聞き入ったけど、結構的確じゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fbede49cb0a6041abce9ec37ec2684b7c5edbf01ed221029dd762926c8da0bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c916a4b9c47411cabf31323c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ギムレットのモクテル。味は悪く\r\nなかったけど、カードのフレーバー\r\nテキストみたいな講釈は何なの？",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a2b3be809e3bde7cd86248027d6c540842d0e6dc7ec9afbb3600ce43884cec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95e24a6217ea421a38d6e714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機械の技術が進歩すれば\r\nいつか背が伸びるような\r\nマシンとかもできるのかな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "399932c3a7f03ff39269696918a801c4592a843e4ce2014c10c62b2534c58de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cc91353e4071d075143b6e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝？早いよ。弁当自分で作ってるし\r\nじゃないとクリークさんが\r\nアタシの分まで作っちゃうから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f43097ca79bbfc4b2291edc7ecdff4cace1817347427a166b81e1d1ae12812",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e14da441c7abe7e070d4f718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アヤベとかブライアンとは屋上で\r\nたまに会うよ？ほとんど喋んない\r\nけど…何か話したほうがいいのかな",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dece8d914d0974fc35e7052f19019e0b8e1cfc05ce844b93606c09fac278148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4908cbecc982a60fae7d68f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この間、始めたばっかなのに、\r\nもうレベルカンストしてんじゃん。\r\nちょっと寝る前にやりすぎたか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "775363262a93135245479dfc157579a4c1c28d8fb7eacc4016a2bac2e864af52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5da1496e3da5f9c7683ba9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春は祝い事多いから、実家の\r\n花屋も結構忙しそうにしてたっけ。\r\n…無理とかしてないといいんだけど",
      "source_fingerprint": "437b565e1ff5b06ad1335c5d2158796d9ec9bfefea7059bb04f9e0c2292e2002",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5860da07835b6eae188556e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海か山かって聞かれたら、山。\r\n人少なそうだし…。でも、それより\r\n涼しい部屋でゲームしたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e87b29338f2ef020fc13732d5ebcbbacba351529b94326471eabb84b9d101b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:140a9e0f1b7d6a3ea0780c3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲の秋か…。暇だし料理でも\r\nしよっかな。飾り切りとか\r\n綺麗にできると謎の達成感あるし…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6363936286e3c9a5908e0fb41066f2302685cd29b962350bcad1fc45c7f9156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:265985abb65d20c9fae13ef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "野良猫を膝に乗せたときのぬくぬく\r\nこの時期だからこそだよね。\r\nあの子もやっぱ1人は寒いのかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a093b15db5b56eae96c80930ede75af171fe51f4ae482990aee183282534441",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f23edeb8e05d4b4d7e19526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目立つのはあんま好きじゃないけど\r\nところどころ光彩入ってサイバーな\r\n感じは…まあ、嫌いじゃないかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b76259ff9216a6dc37770232c0134268f75c8450c382d509f3809114c06da48f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33f0485f591cf64adc4108dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜、これで走ってたらチケットに\r\n流れ星だとか言われたんだけど…。\r\nわかんなくないけど指さすなっての",
      "source_fingerprint": "49eb1997de73ab49a2ce222a43451ad81117d24b3374e6d84b1ac85b7f9076d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c788aed92a86cabe162645d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我就像平时一样就行了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b98a550d645835636aa2fe19bcfda1ecfdc9a73271ca361bfaa3647e63719374",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf06a97bf6168717c6ab353",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やってやる……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2728623afddf1fc87245ca34d13453f44ce90b92313f03d355d1c105d24e64a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c09ddc9bd63a9c361310ac4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样都好……\n但训练可别手软啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cf79bd883000c465e22130b086b836674a2af7dc82961ca64a3eee9f5391f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd45bd21f0defbb48f67d79b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的……明明做好了准备的！\n为什么会这样啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "224190ef7710c6d64e79bf9c9b23755fdde169165395eb5bffb69af2b34c50ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bed172ba8ccb55d787c89f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是不尽快提高实力，\n立马追上去的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e24fdb738aeb1d1f67a2dea5258cf864dd4a34850f4da610ccf87275e2a1b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:851da39072aadac00dce6367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛……毕竟你也是训练员嘛。\n我会听从你的指示的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5498c945f293d8d3b1cdf7524e73964ab2262e95cd80998856f10434708cc453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c71b861a171428dc7ffd52cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用那些多余的担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9cc0df2ad94a6b3096f3f40f7d459e5947bfa44d0fa7381d8a85175d0ac309c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4224d38b81743a4009ddec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的教导方法……\n还算不错……吧……\n不过热血过了头，吵死人了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81a3ec50a8afb97f52db9ac61dce09e845fe385a984063f4208068bfc43d5e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c63eca80313df4c2e991f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，快点吧。\n时间很宝贵的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "704b315ec5ad46d7bed9822d35c39ba895df0371a994886dbd21f662e357213e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b326cb304afa872c4d4df9de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先习惯一下训练节奏，\r\n之后再慢慢加快步调吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0dc82281f335fdb3052dd15242e7c9703d984aabac8502ba5b5f98a6d02986f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:719d3fa6977c50831dfb7a70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "按你的标准来给我打分就行了。\r\n这样的话，我也能更有动力。",
